   "summary": "The number of active businesses in the UK has reached 2,889,575, back above its 2019 level after falling in 2022, 2023 and 2024, according to The UK Business Health Map. The UK Business Health Map is a new interactive resource created by 365 Finance. The SME lender has analysed the Office for National Statistics’ data […]",
